### UC1 Sortiment
GET http://localhost:5001/api/laptops

### UC2 Nach Marke / Preis filtern
GET http://localhost:5001/api/laptops?brand=hp

###
GET http://localhost:5001/api/laptops?maxPrice=800

### UC3 Fast ausverkauft
GET http://localhost:5001/api/laptops?lowStockBelow=3

### UC4 Laptop anlegen
POST http://localhost:5001/api/laptops
Content-Type: application/json

{ "brand": "Dell", "model": "XPS 13", "cpu": "Intel Core Ultra 5", "ramGb": 16, "storageGb": 512, "price": 1499.00, "stock": 10 }

### UC4 Kunde anlegen
POST http://localhost:5001/api/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lena Moser", "email": "lena.moser@example.com" }

### UC5 Laptop verkaufen (customer.id 4 und laptop.id 5 aus den Antworten oben)
POST http://localhost:5001/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 2, "saleDate": "2026-10-12", "customer": { "id": 4 }, "laptop": { "id": 5 } }

### Bestand prüfen
GET http://localhost:5001/api/laptops/5

### UC6 Zu wenig auf Lager -> 409
POST http://localhost:5001/api/sales
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quantity": 3, "customer": { "id": 1 }, "laptop": { "id": 4 } }

### UC7 Verkauf stornieren
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/sales/2

### UC8 Käufe eines Kunden
GET http://localhost:5001/api/customers/1/sales

### UC8 Fehlerfälle
GET http://localhost:5001/api/laptops/99999

###
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/laptops/3

###
DELETE http://localhost:5001/api/customers/1
